            "review_title": "Review at BiaCraft Artisan Ales - Truong Sa",
            "review_text": "Phoenix Nguyen\nHanoi, Vietnam37 contributions\n0\nAlways discovering something new\nMay 2018 • Friends\nMy French friend and I visited the Biacraft at Xuan Thuy Str first but it was fully booked so we decided to move to the new outlet at Truong Sa Str. The parking area is quite small and we had to park the bike at another place. We felt uncomfortable at first impression. Then we up-stair and had \"party sausages\", french fries with green Jalapeño and cheese and of course mango beer. Food and Drink were amazing. I myself find Biacraft at District 2 is more chiller than this outlet. But it would be a good place for party\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 1, 2018",
